# sys-fly: Fly (HM02) from the party menu (decomp field_move_tasks.c FieldMoves_CheckFly and the fly task,
# applications/town_map). Oreburgh City with the Cobble Badge, a Piplup leading (the party follower) and Staraptor
# knowing Fly; Twinleaf, Sandgem and Jubilife were visited (their FLAG_FIRST_ARRIVAL_*). Inside the Pokémon Center Fly
# is refused (the map header forbids it: PartyMenu_Text_CantUseThatHere, the party stays open). Outside, FLY opens the
# Town Map on Oreburgh's cell: the d-pad walks the cursor west, B goes back to the party, FLY again and a tap on
# Jubilife's block picks it. The cut-in, the white fade, the map change and the landing put the player on Jubilife's
# fly point facing down, on foot; the follower was recalled and waits under the player, coming out with the first step.
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_COAL
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_COBBLE
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 20 platinum:MOVE_POUND
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_STARAPTOR 40 platinum:MOVE_FLY platinum:MOVE_QUICK_ATTACK
set flag platinum:FLAG_FIRST_ARRIVAL_TWINLEAF_TOWN true
set flag platinum:FLAG_FIRST_ARRIVAL_SANDGEM_TOWN true
set flag platinum:FLAG_FIRST_ARRIVAL_JUBILIFE_CITY true
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_CITY 303 757 up
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_FIRST_ARRIVAL_OREBURGH_CITY true
# Into the Pokémon Center: Fly is refused there.
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_CITY_POKECENTER_1F"
+0 release up
until idle
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:0
+1 assert app party
+1 tap slot:1
+1 tap menu:1
+1 assert app party
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 press b
+1 release b
+1 press b
+1 release b
until app none
# Back out, then FLY: the Town Map.
+1 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_CITY"
+0 release down
until idle
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:0
+1 tap slot:1
+1 tap menu:1
until app town-map
+20 press left
+15 release left
+10 press b
+1 release b
until app party
+1 tap slot:1
+1 tap menu:1
until app town-map
+20 tap town:7
until app none
until idle 600
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY 180 777
+0 assert facing player down
+0 assert state playerState "walk"
+0 assert state partyFollower {"x":180,"z":777,"facing":"down","waiting":true}
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY 180 777
+0 press down
until position 180 778
+0 release down
until idle
+0 assert state partyFollower {"x":180,"z":777,"facing":"down","waiting":false}
